          "memory": "User and Devon planned pizza dinner at Luigi's on 5th Street on Friday, September 18, 2026 at 6 p.m., meeting there after work to beat the dinner rush as a weekend kickoff with no cooking for User. Devon planned to leave work early, park in back and grab a table, with User heading straight from the office and texting when parking.",
